  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……なんとか、落ち着いた……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0129",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……大丈夫、ちゃんとリカバーできた\r\n連絡も、後処理も終わったし……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（いい大人なんだ、ミス一つで落ち込んでる場合じゃない\r\n そんなことをしている暇があったら──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──あったら……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0129",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──不甲斐ないなぁ、本当に……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "se": "0113",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──おや？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030060040",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "029",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "！\r\n……ああ、咲耶か。こんな時間にどうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ちょっと、忘れ物をしてしまってね\r\nこのあたりに、ペンケースが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110020"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0454",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──ほら、あった\r\nちょうどクッションで隠れてしまっていたようだ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "目的はこれだけだよ\r\n──仕事中のところ、邪魔してしまったね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私たちのために、いつもありがとう\r\n日々楽しく仕事を出来ているのは、全てアナタのお陰だ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、咲耶たちが上手くやってくれてるからだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺なんて、大したことはしてない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……プロデューサー\r\nもしかして、何か……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、何もないさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことより、帰るなら夜道は気をつけるんだぞ\r\nなんならタクシーを呼ぶから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0242",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……咲耶？　帰らないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──ふたりきりのついでに、少し私の話を聞いてほしくてね\r\n……迷惑、だったかい？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いや、そんなことは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、ありがとう\r\nそれで、話というのは──……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……アナタのことだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "006",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………仕事中のアナタの表情\r\nピリッと身が引き締まるような、鋭い眼差しが私は好きだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタの手も、私は好きだ\r\nメモを取る時や運転する時、つい見入ってしまう",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それに、アナタの瞳はとても美しい色をしている\r\nその瞳に私が映る時、すごく幸せな気持ちになれるんだ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さ、咲耶……？　いきなりどうしたんだ……？\r\nあんまり言われると、さすがに恥ずかしいような……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、もう聞いてくれないのかい？\r\n私はまだ、アナタに言いたい言葉が山ほどあるというのに",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──アナタが私にとってどれだけの存在なのか\r\nそう簡単に伝えきれるわけがないだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いつも一生懸命で、\r\n自分よりも私たちを優先する優しいところ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私たちに何かあればすぐに気付き、それとない、\r\nしかし涙が出るような優しさをくれるところも",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私に何かあればすぐに気付いて、\r\n欲しかった言葉をかけてくれる優しいところも好きだよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──何かあっても、\r\n何もないよと笑って全てを背負い込む……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……その優しさは、正直に言ってしまうと少し悲しい",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタが背負うもの、私には想像しきれない\r\n私が笑っている横で、大きな責務を負っているのだろう",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だけど……だからこそ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタの頑張りを、なかったことになんて、しないでほしい",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "自分と向き合うのが悪いこととは言わない\r\n何かで悩むことがただ悪であると断ずるつもりもない",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど、俺なんてとか、そんなこととか……\r\nそんな言葉を、アナタの口から聞きたくはない",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタの頑張りを否定することは、\r\nたとえ誰であっても許さないよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それでもまだアナタがその言葉を口にするならば……\r\n何度だって、アナタの素晴らしいところを囁くとしよう",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それでもアナタが自分を否定するならば……\r\nその万倍の肯定を、私はアナタに押し付けよう",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "さて、どちらをご所望かな？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………はは、俺の負けだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、物分かりが良くて助かるよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。いつまでも落ち込んでるくらいなら……\r\n咲耶の期待に応える仕事をしないとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それは嬉しいけど、だからといって仕事もほどほどにね\r\n……誰かのように、倒れられては大変だ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………アナタのお陰で、今の私はいるんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110320,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから、アナタを愛する人のこと……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006009110330,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタも忘れないで欲しいな、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600911/2006009110330"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]